Isa 54:11; Mr 6:48; Joh 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-25","title":"Matthew 14:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the fourth watch.The Jews at this time divided the night into four watches; the first was from six o'clock in the evening till nine, the second from nine to twelve, the third from twelve till three, and the fourth from three till six; so that it probably began to be daylight before our Lord came to his disciples.</p>\n<p>24:43; Lu 12:38 walking.This suspension of the laws of gravitation was a proper manifestation of omnipotence.</p>\n<p>Job 9:8; Ps 93:3,4; 104:3; Mr 6:48; Joh 6:19; Re 10:2,5,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-26","title":"Matthew 14:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>they were. 1Sa 28:12-14; Job 4:14-16; Da 10:6-12; Mr 6:49,50; Lu 1:11,12 Lu 24:5,45; Ac 12:15; Re 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-27","title":"Matthew 14:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Be. 9:2; Joh 16:33; Ac 23:11 it. Isa 41:4,10,14; 51:12; Lu 24:38,39; Joh 6:20; 14:1-3; Re 1:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-28","title":"Matthew 14:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>bid. 19:27; 26:33-35; Mr 14:31; Lu 22:31-34,49,50; Joh 6:68; 13:36-38 Ro 12:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-29","title":"Matthew 14:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>he walked. 17:20; 21:21; Mr 9:23; 11:22,23; Lu 17:6; Ac 3:16; Ro 4:19 Php 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-30","title":"Matthew 14:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>when. 26:69-75; 2Ki 6:15; Mr 14:38,66-72; Lu 22:54-61; Joh 18:25-27 2Ti 4:16,17 boisterous. or, strong. Lord. 8:24,25; Ps 3:7; 69:1,2; 107:27-30; 116:3,4; La 3:54-57; Jon 2:2-7 2Co 12:7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-31","title":"Matthew 14:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>stretched. Ps 138:7; Isa 63:12; Mr 1:31,41; 5:41; Ac 4:30 and caught. Ge 22:14; De 32:36; Mr 16:7; Lu 22:31,32; 24:34; 1Pe 1:5 O thou. 8:26; 16:8; 17:20; Mr 11:23; Ro 4:18-20; 1Ti 2:8; Jas 1:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-32","title":"Matthew 14:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>come. Ps 107:29,30; Mr 4:41; 6:51; Joh 6:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-33","title":"Matthew 14:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>worshipped. 15:25; 28:9,17; Lu 24:52 Of. 16:16; 17:5; 26:63; 27:43,54; Ps 2:7; Da 3:25; Mr 1:1; 14:61; 15:39 Lu 4:41; 8:28; Joh 1:49; 6:69; 9:35-38; 11:27; 17:1; 19:7; Ac 8:37 Ro 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-34","title":"Matthew 14:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>when. Mr 6:53-56 the land of Gennesaret.Gennesaret was a fertile district, in which were situated the cities of Tiberias and Capernaum, extending along the western shore of the lake to which it gave name, about 30 stadia, or nearly four miles, in length, and twenty stadia, or two miles and a half, in breadth, according to Josephus.</p>\n<p>Lu 5:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-35","title":"Matthew 14:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>4:24,25; Mr 1:28-34; 2:1-12; 3:8-10; 6:55</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-14-36","title":"Matthew 14:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>only. 9:20,21; Mr 3:10; Lu 6:19; Ac 19:11,12 hem. 23:5; Ex 28:33-43; Nu 15:38,39 perfectly. Joh 6:37; 7:23; Ac 3:16; 4:9,10,14-16</p>"}]}